{
  // Returned by describe_server — gives the agent an overview of available storage tools.
  "describe_server": "## Storage Service\n\nProvides access to the shared object store, organised per the ADR-007 folder layout.\n\n### Read-only exploration\nBrowse and read anything in shared storage with `list_files`, `read_file`, `search_files`, `get_file_properties`, and `get_file_summary` (full object keys, `{company_slug}/{area}/...`, no leading slash). Call `describe_folder` with a path prefix to learn what a folder is for.\n\n### Your working directory (produce your outputs here)\nThe `*_working_file` tools act on your own assignment's working directory — you pass only a **filename** (subdirectories allowed); the location is derived from your assignment, so you cannot write outside it. Use `append_working_file` (creates on first append), `replace_in_working_file`, `read_working_file`, `list_working_files`, and soft `delete_working_file`/`restore_working_file`. In qa mode these are read-only: you review the assignment under review, you do not modify it.\n\n### Your materials (your inputs)\nThe `*_material_file` tools expose the materials handed to your assignment — `list_material_files`, `read_material_file`, `get_material_file_properties`. Inline-text materials are read back as their literal content.",

  // Folder descriptions returned by describe_folder, keyed by folder type.
  "describe_folder_task_materials": "**Task materials** — User-submitted inputs for this task (briefs, data files, reference documents). Read-only after task creation.",
  "describe_folder_task_output": "**Task output** — Files created during task execution. This is your working area: write intermediate results and final artefacts here before review.",
  "describe_folder_knowledge": "**Knowledge base** — OKF Markdown source documents for RAG indexing. Managed by the `store-role-documents` CLI command. Treat as read-only from within an agent.",
  "describe_folder_finished_reports": "**Finished reports** — Reviewed, stable report artefacts accessible to all agents and stakeholders.",
  "describe_folder_finished_specifications": "**Finished specifications** — Reviewed technical or functional specifications.",
  "describe_folder_finished_designs": "**Finished designs** — Reviewed design documents (wireframes, architecture diagrams, etc.).",
  "describe_folder_finished_code": "**Finished code** — Reviewed and signed-off code artefacts.",
  "describe_folder_finished_other": "**Finished (other)** — Stable artefacts that do not fit a named category.",
  "describe_folder_audit": "**Audit log** — Append-only JSONL audit entries written by the system. Do not modify.",
